# Normalize to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This plugin ships a hand-written client bundle and Node sources that run on
# Windows, Linux and macOS. Fixing the line ending in both directions means the
# published tarball and a checkout are byte-identical on every platform, so a
# CRLF working copy can never leak into what other people install.
* text=auto eol=lf
